{"obsah":"<p>On the way to the picturesque village of Bory, Vlasta and Šimon had picturesque rain and thunderstorms. Even while building the obstacles and the workshop it didn't look great. Luckily, just before the show the sun came out, so the guys could get the show going in front of the stage (the grass hadn't dried yet). The exhibition stretched to over 30 minutes and the spectators were great. There were volunteers (twice, in fact) and a competition. Afterwards a smaller workshop started, which was packed for the whole next hour, and the kids tried out what they'd seen in the exhibition on a smaller obstacle course.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FP1060033_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FP1060033_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250871\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FP1060034_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FP1060034_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250869\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FP1060035_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F06%2FP1060035_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250866\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://fi